<title>REPUBLIC OF IRELAND: TABLE-Elan Q2 net income rises 43 percent.</title>
<headline>TABLE-Elan Q2 net income rises 43 percent.</headline>
<dateline>DUBLIN 1997-07-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Three months to June 30</p>
<p>		     (million dollars unless stated)</p>
<p>Shr (cents)		  0.38		0.34</p>
<p>Net income		   40.13	     27.98</p>
